    "interpretation": "Fresh strict CPU likelihood and common-count Q using nine-decimal printed PA parameters. The lambda-only slice is effectively flat at the reported precision, supporting weak identification, not proving general equivalence. Endpoint Q differences around 1.8e-4 exceed the suggested 1e-4. Other fitted parameters also differ. Slice is not a profile likelihood: no nuisance parameters were reoptimized. Tiny irregularities include binary64 model evaluation noise."
