  "decision": "Original tests preserved as historical engineering screens. Neither the fixed 0.01 screen nor a per-fit two-build envelope calibrates scientific equivalence; C itself fails the former. Descriptive distributions are broadly similar centrally, with a structured tail outlier. No new pass threshold selected from inspected results. Bootstrap SD remains context, not a confidence band or proof of acceptable bias."
